 provide instructions for connecting the administrator and turnstile computers.\n\n\nThe batch script now includes network connection instructions for both the administrator and turnstile computers, replacing the placeholder IP with the dynamically detected IP address. It also checks the central server on a specific port. If the server is not active, it attempts to launch the server application.  The goal is to ensure real-time synchronization. The script will pause at the end for user review.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_file","args":{"Content":"\"@echo off\\ntitle FITNESS LEGENDS GYM - Sistema Central ERP (Administrador)\\ncolor 0B\\n\\necho ======================================================================\\necho           FITNESS LEGENDS GYM - SISTEMA CENTRAL ERP\\necho       Modulo de Administrador: POS, Caja, Gastos y Cartera de Socios\\necho ======================================================================\\necho.\\n\\nset \\\"APP_DIR=%~dp0..\\\\LEGENDS\\\\release\\\\FITNESS_LEGENDS_TERMINAL-win32-x64\\\"\\nset \\\"EXE_FILE=%APP_DIR%\\\\FitnessLegends.exe\\\"\\n\\nif exist \\\"%EXE_FILE%\\\" (\\n    echo [*] Iniciando aplicacion FitnessLegends ERP (Escritorio)...\\n    start \\\"\\\" \\\"%EXE_FILE%\\\" --main\\n    echo [*] ERP iniciado con exito con el nuevo diseno de Mancuernas y Ambar.\\n    timeout /t 2 >nul\\n    exit\\n) else (\\n    echo [*] Abriendo version web del ERP...\\n    start http://localhost:5174\\n    exit\\n)\\n\"","Overwrite":"true","Path":"\"c:\\\\Users\\\\andre\\\\OneDrive\\\\Desktop\\\\gym\\\\accesos directos\\\\1. SISTEMA_ERP_ADMINISTRADOR.bat\""}}]}
