k for existing fullscreen toggling mechanisms.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"run_command","args":{"CommandLine":"\"Select-String -Path \\\"c:\\\\Users\\\\andre\\\\OneDrive\\\\Desktop\\\\gym\\\\LEGENDS\\\\src\\\\**\\\\*\\\" -Pattern \\\"CARTERA DE CLIENTES\\\"\"","WaitMsBeforeAsync":"5000","toolSummary":"\"Find CARTERA DE CLIENTES in src\""}}]}
